/P 162 0 R
/E (In modern urban environments, the ability to find the shortest path between two locations is essential for a wide range of applications, including GPS navigation systems \(such as Google Maps and Waze\), ride-sharing services \(Uber, Careem\), logistics and delivery planning \(Amazon, FedEx\), and network routing protocols.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
